# Keep the build context small and the image honest: nothing built on the
# developer's machine may leak into the container. Every artefact in the image
# is produced inside the Dockerfile.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/TestResults/

# The frontend is built in its own stage. A stale local build copied in here
# would silently be served instead of the one the image just produced.
src/ShiftReason.Api/wwwroot/

# Local databases and solver scratch.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Not needed to build the app.
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
docs/
deploy/
scripts/
spike/
tests/
*.md
